cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "EMR-HyperNEAT"
abstract: >-
  Eager Multi-Resolution HyperNEAT: GPU-accelerated adaptive-substrate
  neuroevolution. Replaces the sequential quadtree of ES-HyperNEAT with eager
  tensor evaluation on a fixed multi-resolution grid plus variance-based masking,
  turning substrate discovery into batch matrix arithmetic that vectorizes across
  a population.
